{"title":"25","section":"1734","heading":"Omitted","lead":"","tree":[],"notes":[{"topic":"editorialNotes","text":"Editorial Notes"},{"topic":"codification","text":"Codification Section, Pub. L. 96–420, § 15, Oct. 10, 1980, 94 Stat. 1797, which related to severability of provisions, was omitted from the Code as being of special and not general application."}],"sourceCredit":"","releasePoint":"119-102","ancestors":[{"type":"title","num":"Title 25—","heading":"INDIANS","identifier":"/us/usc/t25"},{"type":"chapter","num":"CHAPTER 19—","heading":"INDIAN LAND CLAIMS SETTLEMENTS","identifier":"/us/usc/t25/ch19"},{"type":"subchapter","num":"SUBCHAPTER II—","heading":"MAINE INDIAN CLAIMS SETTLEMENT","identifier":"/us/usc/t25/ch19/schII"}]}